{"id":"88baa992350758ed","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NEncodeRow.md","title":"NEncodeRow","display":"NEncodeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NEncodeRow","parameters":["z1528","z1529","z1530"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NEncodeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1528</span><span>z1529</span><span>z1530</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>z1528</code>、<code>z1529</code>、<code>z1530</code>。</p>\n<p>最近绑定名优先；栈外自由名字 x 编成 length(g)+x。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NEncodeRow z1528 z1529 z1530)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists u\n      (and\n        (exists z1533 (and (@ Pair t u z1533) (@ Pair g z1533 z1530)))\n        (exists z1534\n          (exists z1535\n            (and\n              (@ Omega z1534)\n              (and\n                (@ SeqTo g z1535 z1534)\n                (and\n                  (@ NRaw t)\n                  (and\n                    (@ URaw u)\n                    (or\n                      (exists z1536\n                        (and\n                          (@ NVar z1536 t)\n                          (or\n                            (exists z1537 (and (@ NFirst g z1536 z1537) (@ TVar z1537 u)))\n                            (exists z1538\n                            (and (not (exists z1537 (@ App g z1537 z1536))) (and (@ Add z1535 z1536 z1538) (@ TVar z1538 u)))))))\n                      (or\n                        (exists z1536\n                          (exists z1539\n                            (exists z1540\n                            (exists z1543\n                            (and\n                            (@ NLam z1536 z1539 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons z1536 g z1543)\n                            (and\n                            (@ ULam z1540 u)\n                            (exists z1544\n                            (exists z1545\n                            (and\n                            (in z1544 z1529)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1528 z1544 z1545)\n                            (exists z1546 (and (@ Pair z1539 z1540 z1546) (@ Pair z1543 z1546 z1545))))))))))))))\n                        (exists z1539\n                          (exists z1540\n                            (exists z1541\n                            (exists z1542\n                            (and\n                            (@ NApp z1539 z1540 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ TApp z1541 z1542 u)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1547\n                            (exists z1548\n                            (and\n                            (in z1547 z1529)\n                            (and (@ App z1528 z1547 z1548) (exists z1549 (and (@ Pair z1539 z1541 z1549) (@ Pair g z1549 z1548)))))))\n                            (exists z1550\n                            (exists z1551\n                            (and\n                            (in z1550 z1529)\n                            (and (@ App z1528 z1550 z1551) (exists z1552 (and (@ Pair z1540 z1542 z1552) (@ Pair g z1552 z1551))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" href=\"?note=0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" title=\"ZFC_Add\">Add</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cff538dd049d418\" href=\"?note=3cff538dd049d418\" title=\"ZFC_NApp\">NApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6fdefd03771be4\" href=\"?note=0a6fdefd03771be4\" title=\"ZFC_NFirst\">NFirst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d7c6583016ee6af4\" href=\"?note=d7c6583016ee6af4\" title=\"ZFC_NLam\">NLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" href=\"?note=fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" title=\"ZFC_NVar\">NVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text"